<title>USA: CA Short sets stock dividend.</title>
<headline>CA Short sets stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SHELBY, N.C. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CA Short Co said Thursday its board had set an eight percent stock dividend, payable August 1, record July 16.</p>
<p>No fractional shares will be issued, it said.</p>
</text>
